    "innovation": "This paper presents TerraClimate, a novel high-resolution (~4-km) global dataset of monthly climate and climatic water balance from 1958-2015, created by combining fine-scale climatologies with coarser time-varying data to provide crucial inputs for large-scale ecological and hydrological studies.",
